"imageThumb":"https://images.metmuseum.org/CRDImages/gr/web-large/DP225817.jpg","imageHires":"https://images.metmuseum.org/CRDImages/gr/original/DP225817.jpg","license":"Public Domain","sourceUrl":"https://www.metmuseum.org/art/collection/search/258449","accession":"2009.529","medium":"Terracotta"}],"followUps":["More polite demons","Only Redon","Stranger, less pretty"],"comments":{"aic:106638":"The eyes have lids, lashes and tails, like plankton. Redon lets one small face look out from inside the crescent, and it seems as startled as you are.","mia:32419":"Yellow saucer eyes, a gong on his chest and a prayer tag in his hand. This demon is very much trying to behave.","met:207000":"A bearded man's face on a scaled body, with webbed fingers splayed like a swimmer mid-stroke and a curled fish tail behind.","mia:116849":"A long-limbed yokai on a scroll so narrow it runs the whole height of the wall. He stretches up to grab at the moon."}},"at":50177,"doneAt":50177}]}